WEBVTT

00:08:56.907 --> 00:09:00.070
tetraplegičar.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.108
Ja ne vjerujem.

00:09:04.108 --> 00:09:06.694
U mom umu,

00:09:06.694 --> 00:09:09.456
u mojim snovima

00:09:09.456 --> 00:09:12.296
svake noći

00:09:12.296 --> 00:09:17.211
poput Chagalla

00:09:17.211 --> 00:09:20.339
lebdim gradom,

00:09:20.339 --> 00:09:23.556
lebdim i okrećem se

00:09:23.556 --> 00:09:29.945
dok mi stopala ljube tlo.